{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月19日，法國製藥巨頭賽諾菲宣佈，歐盟委員會已批准其新一代狂犬病疫苗VaxRabeo上市，適用於所有年齡段人羣，可用於狂犬病暴露前及暴露後預防。這是該疫苗在全球首次獲得上市許可。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587096.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:04:09.521621+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:52:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:15.727358+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:15.727358+00:00","content_hash":"4e23a8b5c0bcf4af86c6ae10cd1ad14d511497e1a749ca436dd1f2e70ed43880","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}